{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Grid</strong> is a relentless, fast-paced arcade game set on a deadly 5x5 grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move one tile at a time, reacting to an ever-growing onslaught of traps that will test your reflexes and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to master, each run will likely be less than 5 minutes. Perfect for short, intense sessions on PC and Steam Deck. <br>   <br><strong>Core Traps:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombs</strong>\u00a0fall from the sky and destroy tiles<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/47fc9f852535708be04656daccef116b.poster.avif?t=1756029820\" width=172 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/47fc9f852535708be04656daccef116b.webm?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/47fc9f852535708be04656daccef116b.mp4?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lasers</strong> sweep across rows and columns with deadly precision<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/2f9a17a74944745fa0e2cd6cd31b3434.poster.avif?t=1756029820\" width=800 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/2f9a17a74944745fa0e2cd6cd31b3434.webm?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/2f9a17a74944745fa0e2cd6cd31b3434.mp4?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Strikes</strong> Clusters of danger\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/afb9c11ffff0a61cfcab82940fa50dbf.poster.avif?t=1756029820\" width=336 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/afb9c11ffff0a61cfcab82940fa50dbf.webm?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/afb9c11ffff0a61cfcab82940fa50dbf.mp4?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/ce60a7d8b45a8a3ec11b805f943bb2ea.webp?t=1756029820\" width=100 height=30 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spikes</strong> punish hesitation if you stand still too long<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/34a71761722afce0a28d5e61d523542f.poster.avif?t=1756029820\" width=90 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/34a71761722afce0a28d5e61d523542f.webm?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/34a71761722afce0a28d5e61d523542f.mp4?t=1756029820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810620/extras/ce60a7d8b45a8a3ec11b805f943bb2ea.webp?t=1756029820\" width=100 height=30 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools to Survive:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\